Adding up all the costs: bacon is $10, chicken is $24, strawberries is $12, and apples is $14. So the total is $10 + $24 + $12 + $14 = $60.

Her budget is $65, so subtracting the total cost from her budget gives $65 - $60 = $5.

Therefore, Kelly has $5 left in her budget.

